<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">(a)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">is, as at the date of this Management Information Circular, or was within 10 years before the date of
this Management Information Circular, a director or chief executive officer or chief financial officer of any company that:</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0 0 0 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

