chief executive officer, or chief financial officer, and which resulted from an event that occurred while that person was acting in the
capacity as a director, chief executive officer, or chief financial officer.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0">None of the directors, executive officers or a shareholder holding a sufficient
number of securities of the Company to affect materially the control of the Company:</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

