<P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">Participation of Directors
in Board Meetings</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0 0 0 0.7pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0 0 0 0.7pt">In the year ended December 31, 2024, six board meetings, four Audit
Committee meetings, four Compensation Committee meetings and no formal CGN Committee meetings were held. In the year ended December 31,
2025, 10 board meetings, four Audit Committee meetings, two Compensation Committee meetings and one CGN Committee meetings were held.
The table below outlines attendance by each director.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0 0 0 0.7pt">&nbsp;</P>

