<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="color: #010000">3.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">was granted the option (the &ldquo;<B>Option</B>&rdquo;) to purchase &#9679; Common Shares (the &ldquo;<B>Option
Shares</B>&rdquo;) of the Company;</TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
