<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="color: #010000">7.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">when exercised, the Company will forthwith calculate all applicable Canadian government withholding taxes
