<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0">We acknowledge receipt of a Notice of Change of Auditor (the &ldquo;<B>Notice</B>&rdquo;)
dated January 16, 2025 delivered to us by the Corporation in respect of the change of auditor of the Corporation, to be effective as of
January 16, 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

