<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 10pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center"></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0.05pt 17.8pt 0 0.25in; font-size: 10pt; text-align: right"><IMG SRC="davidson.jpg" ALT=""><B></B></P>

