    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt; color: #004799"><B>XORTX THERAPEUTICS INC.</B></P><P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt"><B>Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements</B></P><P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt"><B>For the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023</B></P><P STYLE="border-bottom: Black 0.5pt solid; margin: 0; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"><B>(Expressed in U.S. Dollars)</B></FONT>&#160;</P></DIV>
