have been prepared in accordance with IFRS Accounting Standards (&ldquo;IFRS&rdquo;) as issued by the International Accounting Standards
Board (&ldquo;IASB&rdquo;).</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

