<P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">The Company entered into an office lease during the year ended December 31,
2022 for which a right-of-use asset was recognized (Note 11). During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company extended its office
lease. A $88,074 right-of-use asset addition was recognized with a corresponding $88,074 increase to the lease liability.</P>

