<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 0 14.2pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: -0.1pt">The </FONT>Company has an incentive
Stock Option Plan (the &ldquo;Plan&rdquo;) for directors, officers, employees, and consultants, under which the Company may issue stock
options to purchase common shares of the Company provided that the amount of incentive stock options which may be granted and outstanding
under the Plan at any time shall not exceed 10% of the then issued and outstanding common shares of the Company.</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

