<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">These warrants are revalued at each reporting period and any gain
or loss is recorded in profit or loss.</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

