the Company in the amount of $150,000 (2024 - $157,500; 2023 - $280,000).</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="margin: 0 0 0 0.5in; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
