    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: right">10,960</TD><TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
