<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0"></P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0">The Company thoroughly examines the various financial instruments and risks
to which it is exposed and assesses the impact and likelihood of those risks. These risks include foreign currency risk, interest rate
risk, market risk, credit risk, and liquidity risk. Where material, these risks are reviewed and monitored by the Board of Directors.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0">There have been no changes in any risk management policies since December 31,
2024.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0"><B></B></P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: justify; margin: 0; color: #004699"></P>

