    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: right">149,761</TD><TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
